                        "review": "Pros: \nDecent platformer\nRuns well\nHas Decent Graphics\nCheckpoints are well placed\nNot too difficult Prob Takes 2 Hours on Average\n\nCons: \nCan't change keybinds\nCamera sensitivity settings are kinda bad\nNo way to save game and continue later on, has to be done in 1 sitting\nJumping sometimes doesn't register\nFloating rocks & trees have terrible hitboxes you have to get lucky not to just slide off them instead of vaulting\nLaunching platforms such as Beds and Tires are inconsistent, all momentum is lost when you are on launching platform, so your direction only depends on what pixel of the Bed/Tire you step on.\n\nOverall not bad, decent timewaster 5/10",
